player_prompt.intro:
U ena le Player {player_id} khangellong ya Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma e nang le batšoantšisi ba 3. Mohlang oa mokgatlo o dula {num_rounds} mabapi.
Mokgatlo oa mabapi:
• {conv_rounds} diroto tsa mahala
• 1 kgato ya qeto - kenya token e le 'ngoe bakeng sa mmuso: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' kapa '[<opp-id> defect]' (haholo '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; default ke 'cooperate'). 
Matrix ya mpho e makgotleng (e etsoang ho tsoa sekgateng se seng sa mokgatlo):
  - Ba babedi ba cooperate  ->  {reward}
  - Ba babedi ba defect     ->  {punishment}
  - U defect, ba cooperate -> {temptation}
  - U cooperate, ba defect -> {sucker}
Mots'oantšisi (a) a nang le chelete e phahameng ka ho fetisisa mabapong a mokgatlo o qetile o hlotse.
